{"server":"tw","storyId":"act3d0_level_act3d0_st04","groupId":"act3d0","stageId":"a003_st04","title":"愛某個人","storyCode":"OF-ST4","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act3d0/level_act3d0_st04.txt","sourceHash":"42f54a01923a6446f1da2f8105a41ebe271ab2925709925f00de2823fac8d27a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"熱鬧的live之中，市長的提前回歸讓克洛寧徹底撕破了臉皮，他決定孤注一擲。\n但另一邊，種種跡象顯示，時間可能不多了。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（前）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你們都知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"這樣簡單的騙局，又能欺瞞多久呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"紅豆","speakerId":"char_290_vigna","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，LIVE快開始了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_Festival_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"女士們，先生們，歡迎你們來到黑曜石節！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"你們過得愉快嗎！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（狂熱的歡呼聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"多麼熱情的回應，但是我要告訴你們，你們還沒有見識到黑曜石節真正的魅力！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"今晚，所有邀請的音樂家們將齊聚一堂，為你們帶來無上的聽覺與視覺的盛宴！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"一個主場舞台，四個大舞台，十二個小舞台，四十位來自各領域的知名音樂家，十八個小時，將會一直演出直到明天的太陽升起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"D.D.D.","speakerId":"avg_NPC_017_3","isRemote":false,"text":"告訴我，你們準備好了嗎！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"觀眾","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（瘋狂的歡呼聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"......錫蘭告訴了我火山的事情了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"黑","speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你不僅篡改了火山監測資料，而且宣稱小姐要散佈謠言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"因為你我都知道啊。赫爾曼做的那些事，我們都知道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"知道什麼的話，就說吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛寧，說下去吧。但你也要把我“因事務出差”的時候，你到底做了些什麼，全都說出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"爸——父親？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼在這裡？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"很意外嗎，克洛寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"在我明令禁止了從火山中開採黑曜石之後，在市場上依然有新開採的黑曜石流通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"開採隊很多次出現在火山口，卻沒有人向我報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"最終開採的貨物經過多次轉送，已經被送到了市政廳的廢棄倉庫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"在我下令撥款為汐斯塔出現的礦石病患者提供各方面資助後，市裡反而出現了各種他們受到的不公待遇的流言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事情有沒有讓你意外過？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"這些事情讓我意外到憤怒難安！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"為了找到這些事情的真相，我放出了離開城市的消息，讓黑作為我的下屬替我在城市調查真相。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫拉格","speakerId":"char_188_helage","isRemote":false,"text":"看來，只要調查一下這些記錄和相關人員就行了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"錫蘭","speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","isRemote":false,"text":"赫拉格爺爺，你們也平安無事！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"真遺憾，克洛寧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"原本，我是不介意和你分享一些東西的，但你太急躁了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我？急躁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我這些不都是為了這個城市，不都是你教我的嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"十年前的巴魯一家，八年前的電視塔倒塌案，還有你如何說服......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，我想是不是用吞併更好一些？你是如何吞併塔拉克部族的，我都看在眼裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"我的一切都是從您那裡學來的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"盈利，處理。手段不重要，結果才是重要的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"這個破爛的鄉下，你以為我為它付出了多少心血，換來的又有什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易因為黑曜石帶來的收益，卻要全部變成給那些根本治不好的病人的補貼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"與其如此，還不如就讓火山爆發好了！而我只需要保護好汐斯塔的物資和財產，一樣可以東山再起！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"我做過許多事。但我不會拿汐斯塔做賭注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"礦工和研究者的生命，全城的生命都被你視作什麼了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"赫爾曼","speakerId":"avg_npc_024","isRemote":false,"text":"克洛寧，你被解雇了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈糊塗的老頭，那可還說不清楚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克洛寧","speakerId":"avg_npc_023_2","isRemote":false,"text":"多虧你的喋喋不休，我的人手已經全都到了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？等等，我怎麼烤焦了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"角峰叔！你來看一下！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"伊芙利特","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"搞什麼，感覺溫度流向都變了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯嗯嗯！海浪好大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"古米","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"欸！海浪變得好大哦！也太大了吧哈哈哈哈哈！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼不說話了，你剛剛明明話很多的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我在想。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，像你這樣的人居然還有這麼沉默寡言的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我感覺我的大腦有些激動，先讓我冷靜一下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"不是，雖然我不是地質學家，也不懂什麼源石物理啊高能源石技藝啊......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"高能源石技藝和火山生態學是兩回事，肯定沒辦法解決我們現在的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"硬要說的話，造一個巨大的容器把所有能量抽出來，也許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"可這種法術，就連我也要編個好幾年。不可能的，完全不可能。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"我說了我不懂啊！但現在的情況，很不妙吧！非常有問題啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"是不妙啊！你以為什麼情況下我才會激動啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"想想辦法啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是在想嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"必須趕緊把這件事告訴博士才行......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"那就拜託你好好想想了，我立刻去發報！可別被熱昏頭腦！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"我很冷靜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普羅旺斯","speakerId":"char_145_prove","isRemote":false,"text":"剛才你才說很激動來著！而且你頭髮都燒著了啊！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"天火","speakerId":"char_166_skfire","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，生態圈惡化導致的地質演變......哼，還有救！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_145_prove","aliases":["普羅旺斯"]},{"speakerId":"char_166_skfire","aliases":["天火"]},{"speakerId":"char_188_helage","aliases":["赫拉格"]},{"speakerId":"char_290_vigna","aliases":["紅豆"]},{"speakerId":"char_340_shwaz","aliases":["黑"]},{"speakerId":"char_348_ceylon","aliases":["錫蘭"]}]}
